S5-07 callback-time virtual-clock ledger exact-nonce replay N=2
Date: 2026-11-16
Host: local macOS/aarch64
Code revision: d324ea6 (clock-ledger instrumentation; no guest CPU or comparator changes)
Runner executable SHA-256: 918f4c1bfe61be3532d4691f3f0bc3fd4af4fe0eacf41138d9ecf35819c34906

Purpose
-------
Replay the two nonces from the automatic dual-site source pair and capture
the first two RDTSC callbacks at entry RIP `0xffffffff8271b31b` with schema-v10
pre-charge clock ledger. The ledger is taken inside the callback before the
current quantum's retired instructions and device ticks are charged.

